#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/private-submodules.rst:2
msgid "How to use private Git submodules"
msgstr "如何使用私有 Git 子模块"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/private-submodules.rst:6
msgid "This guide is for :doc:`/commercial/index`."
msgstr "本指南适用于 :doc:`/commercial/index` 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/private-submodules.rst:8
msgid ""
"If you are using private Git repositories and they also contain private Git "
"submodules, you need to follow a few special steps."
msgstr "若你使用私有 Git 仓库且其中还包含私有 Git 子模块，需遵循几个特殊步骤。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/private-submodules.rst:11
msgid ""
"When a project is created, a SSH key is automatically generated. You can use"
" this SSH key to give Read the Docs access to clone your private submodules."
msgstr "项目创建时会自动生成一个 SSH 密钥。你可以用该密钥授予 Read the Docs 克隆私有子模块的权限。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/private-submodules.rst:16
msgid ""
"You can manage which submodules Read the Docs should clone using a "
"configuration file. See :ref:`config-file/v2:submodules`."
msgstr "你可以通过配置文件管理 Read the Docs 应克隆哪些子模块。参见 :ref:`config-file/v2:submodules` 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/private-submodules.rst:19
msgid ""
"Make sure you are using ``SSH`` URLs for your submodules "
"(``git@github.com:readthedocs/readthedocs.org.git`` for example) in your "
"``.gitmodules`` file, not ``http`` URLs."
msgstr ""
"确保在 ``.gitmodules`` 文件中为子模块使用 ``SSH`` URL（例如 "
"``git@github.com:readthedocs/readthedocs.org.git`` ），而非 ``http`` URL。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/private-submodules.rst:26
msgid "Table of contents"
msgstr "目录"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/private-submodules.rst:29
msgid "GitHub"
msgstr "GitHub"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/private-submodules.rst:31
msgid ""
"Since GitHub doesn't allow you to reuse a deploy key across different "
"repositories, you'll need to use `machine users "
"<https://developer.github.com/v3/guides/managing-deploy-keys/#machine-"
"users>`__ to give read access to several repositories using only one SSH "
"key."
msgstr ""
"由于 GitHub 不允许在不同仓库间复用部署密钥，你需要使用 `machine users "
"<https://developer.github.com/v3/guides/managing-deploy-keys/#machine-"
"users>`__ ，仅用一个 SSH 密钥授予多个仓库的读取权限。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/private-submodules.rst:35
msgid "Remove the SSH deploy key that was added to the main repository on GitHub"
msgstr "移除添加到 GitHub 主仓库上的 SSH 部署密钥"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/private-submodules.rst:39
msgid ""
"If you are using our :ref:`reference/git-integration:GitHub App` to connect "
"your repository to Read the Docs, you can skip this step, because access to "
"your repository is controlled through the App instead of a deploy key."
msgstr ""
"若你使用我们的 :ref:`reference/git-integration:GitHub App` 连接仓库到 Read the "
"Docs，可跳过此步骤，因为仓库访问权限通过 App 而非部署密钥控制。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/private-submodules.rst:42
msgid "Go to :menuselection:`Settings --> Deploy keys` of your repository on GitHub"
msgstr "前往 GitHub 上你仓库的 :menuselection:`Settings --> Deploy keys`"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/private-submodules.rst:43
msgid "Delete the key added by ``Read the Docs Commercial (readthedocs.com)``"
msgstr "删除由 ``Read the Docs Commercial (readthedocs.com)`` 添加的密钥"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/private-submodules.rst:45
msgid ""
"Create a GitHub user and give it read only permissions to all the necessary "
"repositories. You can do this by adding the account as:"
msgstr "创建一个 GitHub 用户，并授予其所有必要仓库的只读权限。可通过将该账户添加为以下身份实现："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/private-submodules.rst:48
msgid ""
"A `collaborator <https://help.github.com/en/github/setting-up-and-managing-"
"your-github-user-account/inviting-collaborators-to-a-personal-repository>`__"
msgstr ""
"`协作者 <https://help.github.com/en/github/setting-up-and-managing-your-github-"
"user-account/inviting-collaborators-to-a-personal-repository>`__"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/private-submodules.rst:49
msgid ""
"An `outside collaborator <https://help.github.com/en/github/setting-up-and-"
"managing-organizations-and-teams/adding-outside-collaborators-to-"
"repositories-in-your-organization>`__"
msgstr ""
"`外部协作者 <https://help.github.com/en/github/setting-up-and-managing-"
"organizations-and-teams/adding-outside-collaborators-to-repositories-in-"
"your-organization>`__"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/private-submodules.rst:50
msgid ""
"A `team in an organization <https://help.github.com/en/github/setting-up-"
"and-managing-organizations-and-teams/adding-organization-members-"
"to-a-team>`__"
msgstr ""
"`组织中的团队 <https://help.github.com/en/github/setting-up-and-managing-"
"organizations-and-teams/adding-organization-members-to-a-team>`__"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/private-submodules.rst:52
msgid ""
"Attach the public SSH key from your project on Read the Docs to the GitHub "
"user you just created"
msgstr "将 Read the Docs 项目的公钥附加到你刚创建的 GitHub 用户"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/private-submodules.rst:54
msgid "Go to the user's settings"
msgstr "前往该用户的设置"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/private-submodules.rst:55
msgid "Click on :guilabel:`SSH and GPG keys`"
msgstr "点击 :guilabel:`SSH and GPG keys`"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/private-submodules.rst:56
msgid "Click on :guilabel:`New SSH key`"
msgstr "点击 :guilabel:`New SSH key`"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/private-submodules.rst:57
msgid ""
"Put a descriptive title and paste the :ref:`public SSH key from your Read "
"the Docs project <guides/creating-project-private-repository:Configuring "
"your repository>`"
msgstr ""
"填写描述性标题并粘贴 :ref:`Read the Docs 项目的公钥 <guides/creating-project-private-"
"repository:Configuring your repository>`"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/private-submodules.rst:59
msgid "Click on :guilabel:`Add SSH key`"
msgstr "点击 :guilabel:`Add SSH key`"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/private-submodules.rst:62
msgid "Azure DevOps"
msgstr "Azure DevOps"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/private-submodules.rst:64
msgid ""
"Azure DevOps does not have per-repository SSH keys, but keys can be added to"
" a user instead. As long as this user has access to your main repository and"
" all its submodules, Read the Docs can clone all the repositories with the "
"same key."
msgstr ""
"Azure DevOps 没有按仓库划分的 SSH 密钥，但可以改为添加到用户上。只要该用户有权访问你的主仓库及其所有子模块，Read the Docs"
" 就能用同一密钥克隆所有仓库。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/private-submodules.rst:70
msgid ""
":ref:`Allow access to your Azure DevOps repository with an SSH key <guides"
"/creating-project-private-repository:Configuring your repository>`."
msgstr ""
":ref:`允许用 SSH 密钥访问你的 Azure DevOps 仓库 <guides/creating-project-private-"
"repository:Configuring your repository>` 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/private-submodules.rst:73
msgid "Others"
msgstr "其他"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/private-submodules.rst:75
msgid ""
"GitLab and Bitbucket allow you to reuse the same SSH key across different "
"repositories. Since Read the Docs already added the public SSH key on your "
"main repository, you only need to add it to each submodule repository."
msgstr ""
"GitLab 和 Bitbucket 允许在不同仓库间复用同一 SSH 密钥。由于 Read the Docs "
"已在你的主仓库上添加了公钥，你只需把它添加到每个子模块仓库。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/private-submodules.rst:81
msgid ":doc:`/guides/creating-project-private-repository`"
msgstr ":doc:`/guides/creating-project-private-repository`"

